WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.180
First, film a real video.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.080
Then go to hicksfield.ai website.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.180
And select AI Influencer, then start generating.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.780
Now start selecting features of your character.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.620
There's a lot of options to choose from.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.840
And here's what I've got.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.240
Then just press Add Motion with Ganjutsu.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.740
Then upload your real video.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.980
No problem is needed, simply press Generate.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:26.800
And that's it.
